# Flanking (CR 702.25a) triggers only when the blocking creature lacks flanking: Bot1's Benalish Cavalry is blocked by Bot2's own Benalish
# Cavalry, which has flanking, so nothing triggers and the two 2/2s trade evenly - both in their graveyards. Compare
# benalish-cavalry-flanking-shrinks-a-blocker-without-flanking, where a flankless blocker is shrunk and the Cavalry survives.

